MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce4091efa6b73194680553dd3dac51da, type: 3}
  m_Name: KatsukoHaruko_Night
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  sequence:
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko are ready to fall asleep...)
    - (I hope Haruko's had an easy Monday... She's not the best, but she's always
      working the hardest in school.)
    - (And I hate to say this, but I hope Katsuko hasn't given her too much trouble...)
    - (As long as they're keeping each other company, I think they can make it through
      high school just fine.)
  alternateSequences:
  - dayOfTheWeek: 2
    sequence:
    - background: {fileID: 0}
      clearBackground: 0
      speakerName: Ryuuji
      dialogue:
      - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko are ready to fall asleep...)
      - (Haruko's always working hard to look after her sisters. It might just be
        by a few minutes, but she's their big sister.)
      - (She's done such a great job keeping her sisters together throughout their
        school journey. Hopefully the pressure doesn't get to her.)
      - (But if it does...)
      - (I'll be here to make a delicious meal to calm her down.)
  - dayOfTheWeek: 3
    sequence:
    - background: {fileID: 0}
      clearBackground: 0
      speakerName: Ryuuji
      dialogue:
      - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko are ready to fall asleep. Katsuko's already
        snoozing, too.)
      - (Even though Katsuko gives us a lot of trouble, I think she cares about her
        sisters the most.)
      - (From elementary school to now, she's always been fighting off bullies, especially
        the ones that pick on her sisters.)
      - (From elementary school to now, no matter how badly she got hurt, she's always
        been fighting off bullies, especially the ones that pick on her sisters.)
      - (As long as she was there for her sisters, she knew her sisters would be
        there for her. Haruko even joined in on the fights when she felt she had
        to.)
      - (But as heartwarming as it is, seeing how tight their bond is, such behaviour
        isn't going to help them find their place in the world...)
      - (That's what Taiga thinks, at least.)
  - dayOfTheWeek: 4
    sequence:
    - background: {fileID: 0}
      clearBackground: 0
      speakerName: Ryuuji
      dialogue:
      - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko are ready to fall asleep...)
      - (I wonder if I should make something different for breakfast. I'd love to
        hear what Haruko would think. She's very attentive to the different sensations
        and flavours of everything she eats.)
      - '(Of course, that doesn''t stop her from splurging on snacks.) '
      - (She might be my biggest fan when it comes to food.)
  - dayOfTheWeek: 5
    sequence:
    - background: {fileID: 0}
      clearBackground: 0
      speakerName: Ryuuji
      dialogue:
      - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko are ready to fall asleep...)
      - (It's crazy how heavy of a sleeper Katsuko is. She managed to fall asleep
        before any of her sisters have.)
      - (... She does get scolded a lot for sleeping during class, though. Where
        did this habit come from?)
      - (She was seriously ill when she was a baby because Taiga had a hard time
        pushing her out... When they were both recovering, they spent a lot of time
        in bed. Could that be the reason? Is there still a part of her that's unwell?)
      - (Or she could just be a big, walking baby that likes to nap, you never know.)
  - dayOfTheWeek: 6
    sequence:
    - background: {fileID: 0}
      clearBackground: 0
      speakerName: Ryuuji
      dialogue:
      - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko are ready to fall asleep...)
      - (I wonder what those two do on their dayouts together...)
      - (The last time I followed them, Katsuko was going around buying little trinkets,
        while Haruko was just... eating.)
      - (Haruko's appetite really is insatiable, huh? Just like her mother's when
        she was her age... Wait, no, Haruko's is muuuuuch more.)
      - (Taiga and Yuuchi eat twice as much as I do, Mitsuko eats three times as
        much as Taiga does, Katsuko eats four times as much as Mitsuko does, and
        Haruko........... I can't even do the math when I compare it to Katsuko.)
      - (She might be eating more than Taiga did while she was pregnant with her
        and her sisters! And Taiga was basically a blackhole for food back then!
        I can't say for sure that Haruko inherited this appetite from Taiga, and
        she definitely didn't get it from me...)
      - (Now, what did Katsuko inherit from her mother?)
      - (.......... I feel like just thinking about the answer would upset Taiga.)
  - dayOfTheWeek: 0
    sequence:
    - background: {fileID: 0}
      clearBackground: 0
      speakerName: Ryuuji
      dialogue:
      - (Looks like Haruko and Katsuko are ready to fall asleep...)
      - (It'll be another week of school for those two.)
      - (Some weeks are better than others, and some weeks...)
      - (....... tend to start and end with Haruko's tears.)
      - (The sisters don't really have good control over their emotions. Haruko's
        happens to cry a lot, like an overgrown baby.)
      - (I always try my best to make Monday the easiest day of the week.)
